                                "sense_id": "4a0a7afa-5a32-3f78-a32a-50071bb03622",
                                "text": "Madam, whatſoeuer you eſteeme\nOf this ſucceſſe, and loſſe vnualued,\nBoth may inueſt you Empreſſe of the Eaſt: […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7b620f0e-e2df-42dc-8c55-68c10782e0d8",
                                "sense_id": "4a0a7afa-5a32-3f78-a32a-50071bb03622",
                                "text": "Mongst which there in a siluer dish did ly / twoo golden apples of vnualewd price: / far passing those which Hercules came by, / or those which Atalanta did entice."
